alled about late delivery; told them we would check tomorrow.\n120: - Dispatched SHP-1024 on 2026-09-19 -> Utrecht. Carrier: DPD. Weight 23.5 kg.\n121: - SHP-1025 went out with FedEx to Leipzig on 2026-09-20, 7.33 kg.\n122: - 2026-09-20: handed SHP-1026 (22.14 kg, destination Bologna) to the DPD driver.\n123: - Planned for next week: SHP-1098 via DHL to Lyon, about 9.5 kg. Not booked yet.\n124: - Dispatched SHP-1027 on 2026-09-20 -> Porto. Carrier: ups. Weight 5.33 kg.\n125: - SHP-1028 went out with DPD to Lyon on 2026-09-20, 47.27 kg.\n126: - Reminder: re-tape pallets before the afternoon pickup.\n127: - 2026-09-21: handed SHP-1029 (29.0 kg, destination Lisbon) to the DHL Express driver.\n128: - Dispatched SHP-1030 on 2026-09-21 -> Madrid. Carrier: DPD. Weight 45.6 kg.\n129: \n130: == whiteboard table ==\n131: | id | date | carrier | weight | destination |\n132: |---|---|---|---|---|\n133: | SHP-1031 | 2026-09-21 | dpd | 7.47 kg | Turin |\n134: | SHP-1032 | 2026-09-21 | FedEx Ground | 6.25 kg | Brno |\n135: | SHP-1033 | 2026-09-22 | ups | 15.2 kg | Seville |\n136: | SHP-1034 | 2026-09-22 | fedex | 13.0 kg | Lisbon |\n137: | SHP-1035 | 2026-09-22 | dpd | 7.4 kg | Bremen |\n138: | SHP-1036 | 2026-09-22 | dhl | 40.64 kg | Lyon |\n139: \n140: == legacy terminal (dates in this section are DD/MM/YYYY) ==\n141: DSP 23/09/2026 SHP-1037 FEDEX            25.75 KG  TO GHENT\n142: 2026-09-23T01:11:12Z WARN  label printer p40 low on paper\n143: DSP 23/09/2026 SHP-1038 DPD            1,250.5 KG  TO NANTES\n144: 2026-09-23T16:48:13Z WARN  label printer p38 low on paper\n145: DSP 23/09/2026 SHP-1039 UPS               35.2 KG  TO UTRECHT\n146: 2026-09-23T16:43:11Z INFO  sync inventory batch=35 rows=0\n147: DSP 23/09/2026 SHP-1040 UPS               9.62 KG  TO BRNO\n148: 2026-09-23T00:16:02Z WARN  label printer p2 low on paper\n149: \n150: end of export\n\n(End of file - total 150 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"Dispatch office log export -- week of 2026-09-14\nPrepared b